Patch for Mic92/hestia v3.1.0 (dfed9ced335d28978ba74e513939a10db1f71025).

The default family remains m3; other refs use m3pr with m3 as read-only
base. Live main locations win; a live own location survives a stale base.
Pack checks are limited to family conflicts and dedup candidates, memoized
per drain; absence is rechecked before known-missing locations are pruned.

